-- [M01-0001] Overview of DBMS_AI_SERVICE
-- Mode: MySQL
-- Package/type: DBMS_AI_SERVICE
-- Official source: https://github.com/oceanbase/oceanbase-doc/blob/017c8d35a015afa04ce1e1ce4b95675e3223c878/en-US/700.reference/600.pl-reference/200.pl-mysql/1000.pl-system-package-mysql/1000.dbms-ai-service-mysql/100.dbms-ai-service-overview-mysql.md
-- Source file: en-US/700.reference/600.pl-reference/200.pl-mysql/1000.pl-system-package-mysql/1000.dbms-ai-service-mysql/100.dbms-ai-service-overview-mysql.md
--   Overview of DBMS_AI_SERVICE
--   The DBMS_AI_SERVICE package is used to manage AI services, including AI model objects and AI model service endpoint objects.
--   Overview of DBMS_AI_SERVICE subprograms
--   The following table lists the DBMS_AI_SERVICE subprograms supported in the current version of OceanBase Database and their brief descriptions.
--   Subprogram | Description
--   CREATE_AI_MODEL | Creates an AI model object.
--   DROP_AI_MODEL | Drops an AI model object.
--   CREATE_AI_MODEL_ENDPOINT | Creates an AI model service endpoint object.
--   ALTER_AI_MODEL_ENDPOINT | Modifies an AI model service endpoint object.
--   DROP_AI_MODEL_ENDPOINT | Drops an AI model service endpoint object.

-- [M01-0002] CREATE_AI_MODEL
-- Mode: MySQL
-- Package/type: DBMS_AI_SERVICE
-- Official source: https://github.com/oceanbase/oceanbase-doc/blob/017c8d35a015afa04ce1e1ce4b95675e3223c878/en-US/700.reference/600.pl-reference/200.pl-mysql/1000.pl-system-package-mysql/1000.dbms-ai-service-mysql/200.create-ai-model-mysql.md
-- Source file: en-US/700.reference/600.pl-reference/200.pl-mysql/1000.pl-system-package-mysql/1000.dbms-ai-service-mysql/200.create-ai-model-mysql.md
--   CREATE_AI_MODEL
--   The CREATE_AI_MODEL procedure is used to create an AI model object, specifying the model's name, type, and other attributes.
--   Syntax
-- Documented syntax/signature (commented; not directly executable); fence language: sql:
--   PROCEDURE create_ai_model(
--       IN name VARCHAR(128),
--       IN params JSON);
--   Parameters
--   Parameter
--   Description
--   Type
--   Value range
--   Nullable
--   name
--   The name of the AI model object.
--   VARCHAR(128)
--   No
--   params
--   The parameters related to the AI model, which must be a JSON object. Supported parameters include: • type: the type of the AI model functionality; model_name: the name of the large model
--   The data types of both type and model_name are JSON STRING
--   type can only be dense_embedding, sparse_embedding, completion, or rerank
--   No
--   model_name specifies the name of the large model, for example, text-embedding-v2
--   No
--   Examples
--   Create an AI model object with type dense_embedding and large model text-embedding-v2.
-- Official example code (commented; setup and privileges may be required); fence language: sql:
--   CALL DBMS_AI_SERVICE.CREATE_AI_MODEL (
--   'my_ai_model_1', '{
--       "type": "dense_embedding",
--       "model_name": "text-embedding-v2"
--     }');
--   References
--   • Overview of DBMS_AI_SERVICE procedures
--   • DROP_AI_MODEL

-- [M01-0003] DROP_AI_MODEL
-- Mode: MySQL
-- Package/type: DBMS_AI_SERVICE
-- Official source: https://github.com/oceanbase/oceanbase-doc/blob/017c8d35a015afa04ce1e1ce4b95675e3223c878/en-US/700.reference/600.pl-reference/200.pl-mysql/1000.pl-system-package-mysql/1000.dbms-ai-service-mysql/300.drop-ai-model-mysql.md
-- Source file: en-US/700.reference/600.pl-reference/200.pl-mysql/1000.pl-system-package-mysql/1000.dbms-ai-service-mysql/300.drop-ai-model-mysql.md
--   DROP_AI_MODEL
--   The DROP_AI_MODEL procedure is used to drop an AI model object.
--   Syntax
