-- [M06-0001] Overview
-- Mode: MySQL
-- Package/type: DBMS_RESOURCE_MANAGER
-- Official source: https://github.com/oceanbase/oceanbase-doc/blob/017c8d35a015afa04ce1e1ce4b95675e3223c878/en-US/700.reference/600.pl-reference/200.pl-mysql/1000.pl-system-package-mysql/13300.dbms-resource-manager-mysql/100.dbms-resource-manager-overview-mysql.md
-- Source file: en-US/700.reference/600.pl-reference/200.pl-mysql/1000.pl-system-package-mysql/13300.dbms-resource-manager-mysql/100.dbms-resource-manager-overview-mysql.md
--   Overview
--   The DBMS_RESOURCE_MANAGER package maintains resource plans, resource consumer groups, and resource plan directives.
--   Privileges
--   The invoker must have the ADMINISTER_RESOURCE_MANAGER system privilege to execute procedures in the DBMS_RESOURCE_MANAGER package.
--   Subprograms
--   The following table describes the DBMS_RESOURCE_MANAGER subprograms supported by the current OceanBase Database version.
--   Subprogram | Description
--   CREATE_CONSUMER_GROUP | Creates a resource consumer group.
--   CREATE_PLAN | Creates a resource plan.
--   CREATE_PLAN_DIRECTIVE | Creates a resource plan directive.
--   DELETE_CONSUMER_GROUP | Deletes a resource consumer group.
--   DELETE_PLAN | Deletes a resource plan and all directives referenced by this plan.
--   DELETE_PLAN_DIRECTIVE | Deletes a resource plan directive.
--   SET_CONSUMER_GROUP_MAPPING | Adds, deletes, or modifies an entry of a login or run-time attribute mapping.
--   UPDATE_PLAN_DIRECTIVE | Updates a resource plan directive.

-- [M06-0002] CREATE_CONSUMER_GROUP
-- Mode: MySQL
-- Package/type: DBMS_RESOURCE_MANAGER
-- Official source: https://github.com/oceanbase/oceanbase-doc/blob/017c8d35a015afa04ce1e1ce4b95675e3223c878/en-US/700.reference/600.pl-reference/200.pl-mysql/1000.pl-system-package-mysql/13300.dbms-resource-manager-mysql/200.create-consumer-group-mysql.md
-- Source file: en-US/700.reference/600.pl-reference/200.pl-mysql/1000.pl-system-package-mysql/13300.dbms-resource-manager-mysql/200.create-consumer-group-mysql.md
--   CREATE_CONSUMER_GROUP
--   The CREATE_CONSUMER_GROUP procedure is used to create a resource user group.
--   Syntax
-- Documented syntax/signature (commented; not directly executable); fence language: sql:
--   DBMS_RESOURCE_MANAGER.CREATE_CONSUMER_GROUP (
--       consumer_group  IN VARCHAR2,
--       comment         IN VARCHAR2 DEFAULT NULL);
--   Parameters
--   Parameter | Description
--   consumer_group | The name of the resource user group.
--   comment | User comments.
--   Examples
-- Official example code (commented; setup and privileges may be required); fence language: sql:
--   CALL DBMS_RESOURCE_MANAGER.CREATE_CONSUMER_GROUP('group1','Transaction Processing Group');
--
--   CALL DBMS_RESOURCE_MANAGER.CREATE_CONSUMER_GROUP('group2','O&M Group');

-- [M06-0003] CREATE_PLAN
-- Mode: MySQL
-- Package/type: DBMS_RESOURCE_MANAGER
-- Official source: https://github.com/oceanbase/oceanbase-doc/blob/017c8d35a015afa04ce1e1ce4b95675e3223c878/en-US/700.reference/600.pl-reference/200.pl-mysql/1000.pl-system-package-mysql/13300.dbms-resource-manager-mysql/300.create-plan-mysql.md
-- Source file: en-US/700.reference/600.pl-reference/200.pl-mysql/1000.pl-system-package-mysql/13300.dbms-resource-manager-mysql/300.create-plan-mysql.md
--   CREATE_PLAN
--   The CREATE_PLAN procedure is used to create a resource plan.
--   Syntax
-- Documented syntax/signature (commented; not directly executable); fence language: sql:
--   DBMS_RESOURCE_MANAGER.CREATE_PLAN (
--       plan          IN   VARCHAR2,
--       comment       IN   VARCHAR2 DEFAULT'');
--   Parameters
--   Parameter | Description
--   plan | The name of the resource plan.
--   comment | User comments.
--   Examples
-- Official example code (commented; setup and privileges may be required); fence language: sql:
