-- [M09] MySQL — DBMS_UDR (PACKAGE)
-- Official package overview: https://github.com/oceanbase/oceanbase-doc/blob/017c8d35a015afa04ce1e1ce4b95675e3223c878/en-US/700.reference/600.pl-reference/200.pl-mysql/1000.pl-system-package-mysql/17800.dbms-udr-mysql/100.dbms-udr-overview-mysql.md
