-- Mode: MySQL
-- Package/type: DBMS_WORKLOAD_REPOSITORY
-- Official source: https://github.com/oceanbase/oceanbase-doc/blob/017c8d35a015afa04ce1e1ce4b95675e3223c878/en-US/700.reference/600.pl-reference/200.pl-mysql/1000.pl-system-package-mysql/17900.dbms-workload-repository-mysql/300.create-snapshot-mysql.md
