-- [M16-0001] Overview
-- Mode: MySQL
-- Package/type: DBMS_EXTERNAL_TABLE
-- Official source: https://github.com/oceanbase/oceanbase-doc/blob/017c8d35a015afa04ce1e1ce4b95675e3223c878/en-US/700.reference/600.pl-reference/200.pl-mysql/1000.pl-system-package-mysql/21000.dbms-external-table-mysql/100.dbms-external-table-overview-mysql.md
