-- [O08] Oracle — DBMS_LOCK (PACKAGE)
-- Official package overview: https://github.com/oceanbase/oceanbase-doc/blob/017c8d35a015afa04ce1e1ce4b95675e3223c878/en-US/700.reference/600.pl-reference/300.pl-oracle/1400.pl-system-package-oracle/9400.dbms-lock-oracle/100.dbms-lock-overview-oracle.md
