-- [O14] Oracle — DBMS_PLAN_CACHE (PACKAGE)
-- Official package overview: https://github.com/oceanbase/oceanbase-doc/blob/017c8d35a015afa04ce1e1ce4b95675e3223c878/en-US/700.reference/600.pl-reference/300.pl-oracle/1400.pl-system-package-oracle/12500.dbms-plan-cache-oracle/100.dbms-plan-cache-overview-oracle.md
