--   attr | Attribute node handle.
--   Return value
--   Attribute node handle.
--   Usage instructions
--   DOMATTR is typically used as a return value or input parameter for attribute-related interfaces. It can be converted into the generic DOMNODE using MAKENODE.
--   Examples
-- Official example code (commented; setup and privileges may be required); fence language: sql:
--   DECLARE
--     attr DBMS_XMLDOM.DOMATTR;
--   BEGIN
--     NULL;
--   END;
--   /

