-- [O34-0001] Overview
-- Mode: Oracle
-- Package/type: DBMS_EXTERNAL_TABLE
-- Official source: https://github.com/oceanbase/oceanbase-doc/blob/017c8d35a015afa04ce1e1ce4b95675e3223c878/en-US/700.reference/600.pl-reference/300.pl-oracle/1400.pl-system-package-oracle/21000.dbms-external-table-oracle/100.dbms-external-table-overview-oracle.md
