-- [O44-0005] END_RESPONSE
-- Mode: Oracle
-- Package/type: UTL_HTTP
-- Official source: https://github.com/oceanbase/oceanbase-doc/blob/017c8d35a015afa04ce1e1ce4b95675e3223c878/en-US/700.reference/600.pl-reference/300.pl-oracle/1400.pl-system-package-oracle/27300.utl-http-oracle/400.end-response-oracle.md
-- Source file: en-US/700.reference/600.pl-reference/300.pl-oracle/1400.pl-system-package-oracle/27300.utl-http-oracle/400.end-response-oracle.md
--   END_RESPONSE
--   END_RESPONSE is used to terminate the HTTP response after the HTTP request is completed.
--   Note
--   This system package is introduced in V4.4.1.
--   Syntax
-- Documented syntax/signature (commented; not directly executable); fence language: sql:
--   UTL_HTTP.END_RESPONSE(
--      r IN OUT NOCOPY resp);
--   Parameters
