-- [S01] Oracle — SA_SYSDBA (PACKAGE)
-- Official package overview: https://github.com/oceanbase/oceanbase-doc/blob/017c8d35a015afa04ce1e1ce4b95675e3223c878/en-US/700.reference/600.pl-reference/300.pl-oracle/1300.pl-label-security-package-oracle/200.sa-sysdba-policy-management-package-oracle/100.sa-sysdba-overview-oracle.md
